n      <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div class=\"label\">在售套餐</div></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"num\">¥15 起</div><div class=\"label\">月付门槛</div></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"num\">3 / 5 / 20</div><div class=\"label\">设备数分层</div></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"num\">年付</div><div class=\"label\">约 10 个月价格</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-band band-4\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"anchor-row\">\n        <a href=\"#plans\">查看套餐</a>\n        <a href=\"#how\">了解接入方式</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n\n<section id=\"plans\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">套餐与价格</h2>\n    <div class=\"h2-sub\">三档套餐，逐级扩展流量、设备数与节点池</div>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-stack\">\n\n      <article class=\"plan plan-1\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">XP-01 · 0337</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-head\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"plan-name\">基础版</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥15<small>按年付 ¥150/年</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-feats\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 流量</li>\n          <li>3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>基础流媒体线路</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan plan-2\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">XP-02 · 0491</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-head\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥35<small>按年付 ¥350/年</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"plan-featured-tag\">推荐</span>\n        <ul class=\"plan-feats\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 流量</li>\n          <li>5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan plan-3\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">XP-03 · 0508</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-head\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"plan-name\">团队版</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥85<small>按年付 ¥850/年</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-feats\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 流量</li>\n          <li>20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">使用说明</h2>\n    <div class=\"h2-sub\">从订阅到连通的四个步骤</div>\n\n    <div class=\"features-grid\">\n      <div class=\"ticket\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">01</span>\n        <h3>选择并订阅</h3>\n        <p>确认需要的套餐档位，提交订阅信息并完成月付或年付。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ticket\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">02</span>\n        <h3>获取接入资料</h3>\n        <p>订阅完成后获得接入地址、端口、加密方式与节点列表等资料。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ticket\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">03</span>\n        <h3>配置客户端</h3>\n        <p>按资料填写客户端参数，导入订阅地址，检查加密与端口一致。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ticket\">\n        <span class=\"serial\">04</span>\n        <h3>连通与排障</h3>\n        <p>完成连通测试，若异常可按说明更换节点或提交工单。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">常见问题</h2>\n    <div class=\"h2-sub\">按主题分组的问答</div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-group\">\n      <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">套餐与计费</h3>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">月付与年付价格如何换算？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">年付约为月付价格的 10 倍，例如旗舰版月付 ¥35，年付 ¥350。年付不含额外折扣，相当于赠送约两个月。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">能否在套餐之间升级或降级？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">支持同方向升级，按剩余天数折算补差价。降级通常需等当前周期结束后生效。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">流量是否支持结转？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">当月未用完的流量默认不结转至下月，团队版可向客户经理申请例外。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-group\">\n      <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">设备与使用</h3>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">同时在线设备数如何计算？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">统计同一订阅下并发连接的设备数量。基础版 3 台、旗舰版 5 台、团队版 20 台。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">超出流量额度后会怎样？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">当月流量耗尽后服务会暂停，等待下一周期重置，或选择升级到更高套餐。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">支持哪些客户端？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">支持常见开源代理客户端，具体名称以接入资料附带的清单为准，本页不列品牌名。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-group\">\n      <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">支持与排障</h3>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">工单响应时长？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">基础版与团队版按通用工单渠道处理；旗舰版享有 7x24 优先工单，团队版配专属客户经理。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\">节点出现延迟变高怎么处理？</div>\n        <p class=\"faq-a\">先更换同一区域内的其他节点；若仍异常，提交工单并附测试时间与节点编号。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">极脉网络 XPulse</div>\n    <nav class=\"links\">\n      <a href=\"#plans\">套餐</a>\n      <a href=\"#how\">使用说明</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"meta\">\n      本页仅展示当前在售套餐与使用说明，具体价格与权益以订阅页面实时信息为准。<br>\n      不提供下载链接与交易入口，需通过订阅渠道获取客户端与接入资料。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</main>",
